WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.880
The T. rex stomped toward Metro City Elementary School.

2
00:00:08.881 --> 00:00:12.678
Roar! The entire school shook.

3
00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:19.016
The T. rex peered into a window.

4
00:00:19.017 --> 00:00:24.609
Terrell gulped. "I thought it would be cool to see real live dinosaurs.

5
00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:27.644
I don't think so anymore!"

6
00:00:27.645 --> 00:00:30.829
"Look at those teeth!" Jack cried.

7
00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:34.527
"I hope Rocket Girl comes soon!" said Mara.

8
00:00:34.528 --> 00:00:40.070
Suddenly— zoom! Roxy flew past the T. rex's

9
00:00:40.071 --> 00:00:42.944
head. "Rocket Girl!" cried

10
00:00:42.945 --> 00:00:45.668
Terrell. Roxy landed in the kickball field.

11
00:00:45.669 --> 00:00:53.062
"Hey, T. rex! Try to get me!"

12
00:00:53.063 --> 00:00:59.338
The T. rex roared and stomped toward Roxy.

13
00:00:59.339 --> 00:01:05.269
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams blasted a big hole in the ground.

14
00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:11.503
The T. rex tumbled into it. Roar!

15
00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:15.505
The dinosaur stomped around in the hole, trapped.

16
00:01:15.506 --> 00:01:20.189
Roxy was about to fly away when she noticed a jeep nearby.

17
00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:24.695
The man inside had a pair of binoculars and a safari hat.

18
00:01:24.696 --> 00:01:28.180
He was watching two tall dinosaurs eat leaves.

19
00:01:28.181 --> 00:01:30.704
"Hmm," thought Roxy.

20
00:01:30.705 --> 00:01:33.610
"I wonder who that man is."

21
00:01:33.611 --> 00:01:37.123
Just then the man looked at Roxy and gasped.

22
00:01:37.124 --> 00:01:41.151
He dropped the binoculars and drove off fast.

23
00:01:41.152 --> 00:01:44.791
"Now that is suspicious!" said Roxy.

24
00:01:44.792 --> 00:01:50.478
She blasted into the air and flew after the jeep.

25
00:01:50.479 --> 00:01:54.195
Roxy followed the jeep into the mountains.

26
00:01:54.196 --> 00:01:57.475
It soon arrived at a large mansion. The

27
00:01:57.476 --> 00:02:04.810
man jumped out of the jeep and ran inside. Whiz-hoo!

28
00:02:04.811 --> 00:02:11.296
Roxy blasted open the mansion's doors and went in. But

29
00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:15.460
she didn't see the man anywhere. Using

30
00:02:15.461 --> 00:02:18.193
her super hearing, she listened. Tick-tock

31
00:02:18.194 --> 00:02:21.376
, tick-tock ,

32
00:02:21.377 --> 00:02:28.588
tick-tock. Roxy could hear many clocks, all ticking at

33
00:02:28.589 --> 00:02:33.910
once. Roxy followed the sounds to the

34
00:02:33.911 --> 00:02:38.625
basement. There she found a laboratory full of clocks, watches, and

35
00:02:38.626 --> 00:02:42.172
calendars. The man with the safari hat stood before a giant

36
00:02:42.173 --> 00:02:48.460
clock. Instead of hours and minutes, years and centuries marked the

37
00:02:48.461 --> 00:02:51.347
clock. "How did you get in here?" asked the

38
00:02:51.348 --> 00:02:55.224
man. Roxy didn't answer. "Who are you?" she

39
00:02:55.225 --> 00:02:57.618
asked. The man folded his

40
00:02:57.619 --> 00:03:00.547
arms. "I'm Professor Flashback," he

41
00:03:00.548 --> 00:03:03.020
said. "And I'm time

42
00:03:03.021 --> 00:03:06.039
traveling." "Time traveling?" asked

43
00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:09.160
Roxy. "Yes," said Professor

44
00:03:09.161 --> 00:03:12.459
Flashback. "I wanted to study real live

45
00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:16.892
dinosaurs. So I made Metro City travel millions of years into the past."

46
00:03:16.893 --> 00:03:21.256
"Well, you have to return the city to the present," said Roxy.

47
00:03:21.257 --> 00:03:24.882
"Dinosaurs are destroying everything!"

48
00:03:24.883 --> 00:03:28.056
"Hmm," said Professor Flashback.

49
00:03:28.057 --> 00:03:31.938
"The present is so . . . boring.

50
00:03:31.939 --> 00:03:35.016
Let's go to the Stone Age instead!"

51
00:03:35.017 --> 00:03:37.695
He reached for the clock's hand.

52
00:03:37.696 --> 00:03:42.209
"No!" said Roxy. "You can't just—"

53
00:03:42.210 --> 00:03:45.647
Smash! The laboratory door burst open.

54
00:03:45.648 --> 00:03:52.458
Dinosaurs swarmed inside!

